:scale-[1.02]\" href=\"/paycheck-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg>Calculate Now</a><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive hover:bg-accent dark:hover:bg-accent/50 h-8 rounded-md gap-1.5 px-3 has-[&gt;svg]:px-2.5 lg:hidden text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" aria-label=\"Toggle mobile menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 18h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"flex-1\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Child Tax Credit 2026: Complete Guide to Eligibility, Amounts, and OBBBA Changes\",\"author\":[{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\",\"affiliation\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc Research Division\"}}],\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-04\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-04\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"about\":[\"Taxation\",\"Public Finance\"],\"abstract\":\"This guide provides a comprehensive overview of the Child Tax Credit (CTC) for the 2026 tax year under the One Big Beautiful Bill Act (OBBBA). It covers eligibility requirements, credit amounts, phaseout thresholds, and refundability rules.\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/research/child-tax-credit-guide-2026\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Dataset\",\"name\":\"Child Tax Credit 2026: Complete Guide to Eligibility, Amounts, and OBBBA Changes\",\"description\":\"This guide provides a comprehensive overview of the Child Tax Credit (CTC) for the 2026 tax year under the One Big Beautiful Bill Act (OBBBA). It covers eligibility requirements, credit amounts, phaseout thresholds, and refundability rules.\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/research/child-tax-credit-guide-2026\",\"creator\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc Research Division\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-04\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-04\",\"license\":\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Research\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/research\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"child-tax-credit-guide-2026\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/research/child-tax-credit-guide-2026\"}]}</script><article class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><a class=\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"/research\">Research</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span class=\"text-foreground font-medium\">child-tax-credit-guide-2026</span></nav><header class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>Original Research Study</div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Child Tax Credit 2026: Complete Guide to Eligibility, Amounts, and OBBBA Changes</h1><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><span>By Rachel Mitchell, CPA</span><span>•</span><span>Published July 4, 2026</span></div></header><section class=\"mb-10 rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/30 p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Abstract</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">This guide provides a comprehensive overview of the Child Tax Credit (CTC) for the 2026 tax year under the One Big Beautiful Bill Act (OBBBA). It covers eligibility requirements, credit amounts, phaseout thresholds, and refundability rules.</p></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Key Findings</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-baby mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 16c.5.3 1.2.5 2 .5s1.5-.2 2-.5\"></path><path d=\"M15 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M19.38 6.813A9 9 0 0 1 20.8 10.2a2 2 0 0 1 0 3.6 9 9 0 0 1-17.6 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-3.6A9 9 0 0 1 12 3c2 0 3.5 1.1 3.5 2.5s-.9 2.5-2 2.5c-.8 0-1.5-.4-1.5-1\"></path><path d=\"M9 12h.01\"></path></svg><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">CTC doubled to $2,200 under OBBBA</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">OBBBA doubled the Child Tax Credit to $2,200 per qualifying child, indexed to inflation.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Up to $1,700 refundable</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Up to $1,700 of the CTC is refundable as the Additional Child Tax Credit (ACTC).</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Phaseout at $200K/$400K</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">The CTC phases out at $200,000 (single) and $400,000 (married) MAGI.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Methodology</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Based on the statutory text of OBBBA (P.L. 119-1), IRS Publication 972, and Revenue Procedure 2025-25.</p></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Data &amp; Findings</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4\">The table below shows how the Child Tax Credit phases out for single and married filers at various income levels.</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border/30\"><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead class=\"bg-card/50\"><tr><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-foreground\">MAGI</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-foreground\">Single Filer CTC</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-semibold text-foreground\">Married Filer CTC</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-semibold text-foreground\">Per-Child Credit</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-semibold text-foreground\">Refundable Portion</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-border/20\"><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$50,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$100,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$150,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$200,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$210,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$1,700</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">Varies</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$300,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$0</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">Varies</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$400,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$0</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$2,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$410,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$0</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$1,700</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">Varies</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$500,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$0</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$0</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">Varies</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$1,000,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-muted-foreground\">$0</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">$0</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right text-muted-foreground\">Varies</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400\">Up to $1,700</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Discussion &amp; Implications</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">The CTC is one of the most significant federal tax benefits for families. Under OBBBA, the credit is doubled vs pre-TCJA law and indexed to inflation. The refundable portion is critical for lower-income families.</p></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">References</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><li>One Big Beautiful Bill Act, P.L. 119-1 (2025).</li><li>IRS. (2026). <em>Publication 972: Child Tax Credit</em>.</li><li>IRS Revenue Procedure 2025-25.</li><li>Internal Revenue Code Section 24, as amended by OBBBA.</li><li>Tax Foundation. (2025). <em>Analysis of OBBBA Child Tax Credit Provisions</em>.</li></ul></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-emerald-500/10 p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Explore More</h2><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"inl